        },
        {
          "text": "Abākirizi bishura Farawo, bati N’ ukw abagore b’Abaheburayo batamera nk’ab’ Abanyegiputa, kuko banyarutsa, bakavyara umwākirizi atarabashikīra.",
          "type": "text",
